1	// TEMPORARY — local preview only, for choosing the headline/subline. Delete this file and its
2	// <script> tag in index.html once a choice is locked in, same as the font/gold/position buttons
3	// used earlier in phase 2.
4	//
5	// Why these seven: current fixes the free-Qaida overpromise (not live yet) while keeping the
